---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Our Process – Utah Oasis Homes">
  <section class="section" id="process-page">
    <div class="section-header">
      <h1 class="section-title">Our Process</h1>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        A thoughtful, well-managed experience that keeps decisions clear and progress easy to follow.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="process-page-image">
      <img
        src="/images/process-courtyard.jpg"
        alt="A covered courtyard with skylights, large windows, and indoor-outdoor living spaces"
        width="1400"
        height="1050"
        loading="eager"
      />
    </div>

    <div class="card-grid">
      <article class="card">
        <h2>01 — Discover</h2>
        <p>
          We begin by understanding your lifestyle, priorities, budget, land, and the ideas already
          taking shape. This gives every decision that follows a clear foundation.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>02 — Design</h2>
        <p>
          Together with trusted design partners, we translate your priorities into a home that responds
          thoughtfully to its site, natural light, views, and daily use.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>03 — Build</h2>
        <p>
          During construction, clear schedules, regular updates, and purposeful site walkthroughs keep
          you informed and connected to the progress of your home.
        </p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <h2>04 — Live</h2>
        <p>
          We complete the process with a thoughtful handover, a detailed walkthrough, and support as you
          settle into a home designed around the way you live.
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
